# Stinkweed Imp: "Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a creature, destroy that creature." A triggered ability, not
# deathtouch (its ruling; CR 603.2, 510.2): Bot1's flying Imp attacks and Bot2 blocks with Endurance, a 3/4 with reach. The
# Imp's 1 combat damage is far from lethal, but it triggers the ability, which destroys Endurance; Endurance's 3 damage kills
# the 1/2 Imp.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Stinkweed Imp
Plains x3
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Endurance
Forest x5
Forest x20

