Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Stinkweed Imp.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot2.Hand.Endurance.Cast
